{"ref":"BDB, בֹ֫סֶר","hw":"בֹ֫סֶר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בֹ֫סֶר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Isaiah 18:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.18.5\">Is 18:5</a></sup> <strong>unripe or sour grapes</strong> coll. <strong>(</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">בּוּסְרָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒܶܣܽܪܬܳܐ</span> (PS; syllable <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒܶ</span> uncertain [Nes, privately]; Polyglotts and Castell have <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒܣܰܪܬܳܐ</span>); Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">بُسْرٌ</span> <em>unripe dates</em><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּסֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 18:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.18.5\">Is 18:5</a> + 3 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּסְרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 15:33\" href=\"/Job.15.33\">Jb 15:33</a>;—<em>unripe grapes</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 18:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.18.5\">Is 18:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 15:33\" href=\"/Job.15.33\">Jb 15:33</a>; <em>sour g.</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.29\">Je 31:29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:30\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.30\">30</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.2\">Ez 18:2</a>.","next":"BDB, בעד","prev":"BDB, בסר"}